<div id="2026-10-29-healthkitchen-owner-chart" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-29 — Owner chart, ciphertext only</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> <code>/healthkitchen/history</code> has a chart for birth year, allergies, food-changing conditions, medications, avoided foods, and the week’s goal. The text is encrypted. A site-admin share is refused. There is no practitioner grant, so only the signed-in owner can read it.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Recipes and the week plan need that history. A dump of the text fields must not show the words, and no one else has been granted access.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Util/HealthKitchen.pm</code>, <code>Controller/HealthKitchen.pm</code>, <code>root/healthkitchen/history.tt</code>.</p>
</div>
